  GarbhSacredStory('Prahlada’s Quiet Home', 'Bhagavata Purana', [1, 2], 'During a noisy and busy time, Prahlada\'s mother found a very quiet, peaceful place to stay. Every night, she listened to calm and happy stories. The baby inside felt so safe and peaceful that he grew up to be a very kind and gentle person, carrying that quiet happiness with him forever.', 'A calm heart makes a calm and happy baby.'),
