  GarbhSacredStory('Dhruva’s Quiet Spot', 'Vishnu Purana', [2], 'Dhruva was a little boy who felt pushed aside by others. He didn\'t cry or get angry; instead, he walked into the woods and sat down quietly. He felt so happy and peaceful inside that he became like a bright, steady star in the sky, shining for everyone to see.', 'When you find peace inside, you shine bright outside.'),
